# .graphifyignore — keep graphify scans FAST and reliable on this repo.
# Without this file, detect() walks the ENTIRE tree: node_modules (61k files),
# agent/backups (24k files), agent/docs, dist, CZVault → the rebuild takes
# forever or dies. Each line is an fnmatch pattern matched against any path part.

# Build output (never graph these)
node_modules
dist
dist-electron
dist_web
out
release
coverage
build
.vite

# Agent artifact mountains (huge, not source)
agent/backups
agent/docs
agent/state-archive.md
CZVault
graphify-out
TEMP

# VCS / tooling / junk
.git
*.log
*.pid

# Scratch
probe-artifacts